{"track":"python","category":"딕셔너리","level":2,"title":"키가 없으면 기본값","desc":"<p>딕셔너리 <code>d</code>에 <code>key</code>가 있으면 그 값을, 없으면 <code>default</code>를 돌려주는 <code>get_or_default(d, key, default)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def get_or_default(d, key, default):\n    pass\n","solution":"def get_or_default(d, key, default):\n    return d.get(key, default)\n","hint":"<p><code>d.get(키, 기본값)</code> 을 쓰면 키가 없어도 에러가 나지 않아요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"get_or_default({\"a\": 1}, \"a\", 0)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"get_or_default({\"a\": 1}, \"b\", 0)","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"get_or_default({}, \"x\", \"none\")","expected":"none","visible":false},{"call":"get_or_default({\"k\": None}, \"k\", 5)","expected":null,"visible":false}],"id":"py-061"}